    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que calcula la distribución de edad de los pacientes al inicio de su observación, estratificada por género:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    c.concept_name AS gender,\n    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM op.observation_period_start_date) - p.year_of_birth AS age_at_observation_start,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT p.person_id) AS number_of_patients\nFROM\n    person AS p\nJOIN\n    observation_period AS op\n    ON p.person_id = op.person_id\nJOIN\n    concept AS c\n    ON p.gender_concept_id = c.concept_id\nGROUP BY\n    c.concept_name,\n    age_at_observation_start\nORDER BY\n    c.concept_name,\n    age_at_observation_start;\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CnsBjz1rXz5S_8glPnxrbQFTESRLvsg9QH7Ri8w7ZUzmk0rD2gLDHNLS1JPVulWB5u169myTghOp41NiH0eNYQOrOf1vCmGgIxRMWWVEs8kuGsvxzFw1Yz-jOj7nd2sJsIarBwivA1gzvH5Z_VlJL7ajX7RQuMKI8iUAZ_0="
